{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2dd5b73be0729600e4e18bbd13f052d8fa7fb80fac8703aef2c6affa9a285748", "ja": "莉緒と風花はまつり達にも結婚観を尋ねる。\r\nお城で王子様を待ち続けているというまつり\r\nと、空飛ぶ結婚式にしたいと話す麗花。豪華\r\nなセレブ婚を語る千鶴。多忙なプロデュー\r\nサーは千鶴の差し入れで、気合いを入れる。", "zh": "莉绪和风花也向茉莉她们询问婚姻观。\n茉莉表示她会在城堡里一直等待王子，\n丽花则说她想举办飞在空中的婚礼。\n千鹤谈论着豪华的名流婚礼。忙碌的制作人\n收到千鹤的慰劳品，精神为之一振。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "257a37dec6146a3c131b8a2843888ba6f882442417445e383a0997c290f4fbe7", "ja": "じー……。", "zh": "（盯）…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "39051e300a62349409b3fc126eb66510e19106434cd9da6649718207a852e730", "ja": "あ、あの……。莉緒さん？\nどうして私のこと見つめてるんですか？", "zh": "那、那个……莉绪？\n你为什么一直盯着我看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "55ca2c174f0299cb47071d0559fd5ec073d75e7d02c08b899f5d5932d4ca2d52", "ja": "風花ちゃんって、ホントにカワイイわよね～。", "zh": "风花真的很可爱呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "5c61fe51cc8e6445f9a917042f8e1a3aed104db265531b60b56f3a9f0e9f087f", "ja": "『結婚したいアイドルランキング』トップ10なのも\n風花ちゃんなら納得しちゃうわ。", "zh": "如果是风花的话，是能接受她有进入\n『想和她结婚的偶像排行榜』前10名。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "10e4fa69f3f2e4c2105d1c3de718a8bc3aee706d92a9a1231abceb9d75a05002", "ja": "え、ええっ！？\nいきなりどうしたんですか、莉緒さん！", "zh": "咦、咦咦！？\n莉绪，你怎么突然说这些！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "88f28724838f429c083180b8f4e86705f258dec32594510e821f112216a4930c", "ja": "あれから私もいろいろ考えちゃって。どうしたら\n女友達じゃなくて、お嫁さん候補になれるかなぁって。", "zh": "在那之后我也思考了很多。\n要怎么做才能成为新娘候选人，而不是只当女性朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "f014fcd26701b4c90de242f7c0e7993100cd5314cf597a76e6ec14593290bba0", "ja": "それで、とりあえず風花ちゃんを見て\n勉強しようと思ったってわけ！", "zh": "然后我就想说，\n先来观察风花学习一下好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "df1224604adb95812cd551fb41708b95494df5a1049fba5d055e8ce62677d94f", "ja": "あ、ランキングの話……。でも、私は莉緒さんの方が、\nずっとずっと素敵だな～って思ってるんですよ？", "zh": "啊，是在讲排行榜的事……\n不过，我倒觉得莉绪比我完美多了耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1cc433cc0fc693b7ea28b09895fae9ef010bccf00966a06cbcf5a100134f5729", "ja": "明るくて、行動力もあって、さりげなく優しくて。\nそんな莉緒さんに、私……、憧れてます♪", "zh": "既开朗又有行动力，还会不经意地流露出温柔，\n我很崇拜……这样的莉绪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "d6830214d38049001246130859b34aab4da4c7f012ae778b69a43d4a564e8077", "ja": "風花ちゃん……。ううっ、ありがと～！\nもういっそのこと、私たちで結婚しちゃおっか！？", "zh": "风花……呜呜！谢谢你～！\n干脆我们两个结婚算了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "42fd8e3fd988f0c357ef5d60d4aa688994a246ecfa2ab782daaf7a39775c9e7a", "ja": "はい！？　へ、変なこと言わないでください～。\n莉緒さんには、絶対いい人が現れますってば～！", "zh": "咦！？别、别讲这种奇怪的话啦～\n莉绪一定会遇到好对象的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1011_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "eddcca0cc379377af2227ef171f7f76b60a3d1f7e6aa4bfa53c62dd8f411d085", "ja": "お、莉緒と風花。おはよう。", "zh": "哦，莉绪跟风花，早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "64924a5a8cff3ac5c35c4ad8a343d16aee7a5b08255edf991447fbdae65b7666", "ja": "あら、おはよ、{$P$}くん♪", "zh": "哎呀，早安，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2e65a51879bc34b25c8982e61ebcaef351a7b95f1c5c977f634a3a2a10d508d9", "ja": "お、おはようございます。\nあ、千鶴ちゃん達も一緒なんですね。", "zh": "早、早安。\n啊，千鹤她们也在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f012a5a41f4361e5afa3fc8c0be07695a328df8f0d6507a752b1e552f54024f1", "ja": "ああ。この後、『ハピマリ』の撮影があるから、\n大学の講義が終わった3人を迎えに行ってたんだ。", "zh": "对啊，因为等等要拍摄『幸福婚礼』，\n我就去接大学上完课的三个人过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "a661a151b8a141bfb4dca08a3e8875b5eaa61cd8f78aa6649269299d1b653606", "ja": "ほ？　姫が通っているのは、魔法学校なのですよ？\n妖精さんと一緒に、魔法のお勉強をしているのです。", "zh": "哦？公主上的可是魔法学校唷，\n跟妖精一起学习魔法那种的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "cbebc0f2d2d239d2f5bd2107dc55e5d7b63ec39341a6577fa745568b404d9813", "ja": "わぁ、すっごく楽しそうな学校なんだね♪\nやっぱり魔法のサークルとかがあるのかな？", "zh": "哇～感觉是很好玩的学校呢♪\n果然会有什么魔法社团之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "55b6608694e7363d90eadba65bb84d11448261ee45d60883d820fe955f26c757", "ja": "もちろんなのです！　空とぶフットサルサークルとか、\nペガサス乗りサークルとか、いろいろあるのですよ？", "zh": "那是当然的呀！像是飞在空中的室内足球社、骑飞马社，\n各式各样的社团都有的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "e222ec6aada4c536ed0e6264930374f401d31437aa05214a40818de6de3fcc5c", "ja": "千鶴ちゃんの大学はどういうところなのです？\nもしかして、セレブサークルがあるのですか？", "zh": "小千鹤的大学是什么样子的呀？\n该不会有名流社团？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "0d174cd2e509738b8dc77dcb07cded5ed273c427e0c9fe3301c5c0790563bf5a", "ja": "えっ！？　ええと……そ、そうですわね！\nさ、サロン……のようなものがありましてよ。", "zh": "咦！？呃……对、对啊！\n有、有像是……沙龙的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "529096586b320e0ad4a3b1d77bec57fa29d93647640f5797fd85aaca3773b809", "ja": "自分たち……のシェフが持ちよったお菓子とお茶で、\nアフタヌーンティー……などを、楽しんでいますわ。", "zh": "我们……的主厨会各自带点心和茶过来，\n然后享用下午茶……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "a4f52737e2384e8ecce889b32cf9f10263a2059c9147987238cb1127655ee031", "ja": "いいわよね、女子大生って感じで。……で・もっ。\nサークルといえば恋愛よね？　そうなのよね！？", "zh": "好棒喔，感觉就很女大学生……不、过！\n说到社团就会想到谈恋爱了对吧？没有错吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "7bfc685a3b8224de05f0672ef66f33522c2a5dbec556283733e6d54d1a462b73", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうですわね。\n中にはそういう方も……。", "zh": "咦？这、这个嘛，\n里面也是有这样的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "70cd8e696b88a4a129abee8b603205aae006071202d82851ecbefb38fcbbec37", "ja": "やっぱり！　ねえねえ、その先は？　結婚については？\nやだ、もったいぶらないでお姉さんに教えてよ～！", "zh": "我就知道！欸欸，然后呢？有没有论及婚嫁？\n讨厌，不要卖关子快告诉大姊姊啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "ba9af61c4ec096e0512477a251afe899fff78fd85faf13379a165eb199363284", "ja": "ほら、みんなもう結婚できちゃう歳なんだし！\nねえねえ、お姉さんに教えてよ～！", "zh": "你看嘛，大家都已经是可以结婚的年龄了！\n欸欸，快告诉大姊姊啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e1ed05ba33ed194a94c460517612a2ad7f92b677a45f2b635661486519be8ff5", "ja": "り、莉緒さん……\nお酒、飲んでませんよね……？", "zh": "莉、莉绪……\n你应该没有喝酒吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "b779d13ea88a8cab876616018fd75d67b738abca1dbf3ce4553b076659bbf4c1", "ja": "ほ？　つまり、まつりたちの結婚観が聞きたいのです？\nいいのですよ♪", "zh": "哦？也就是说，你们想听茉莉我们的婚姻观呀？\n可以的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "8fa4d82d4e1dd831a16e6c4f1f2b4d2f7f3ed59de853a70c3de5a7ac6c9a9706", "ja": "まつりは姫なので、お城でフワフワな夢を見ながら\n白馬に乗った王子様を、ずっと待っているのです。", "zh": "因为茉莉是公主，所以会在城堡做着\n轻飘飘的美梦，并等待骑着白马的王子的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "24368608ec53be86ec5d419b11d56168c99c6edffc93e0fc714fbc1049ecba34", "ja": "その時が来たら、きっとまつりを迎えにきてくれる\nはずなのです。姫は信じているのですよ。……ね？", "zh": "到时候，他一定会来迎接茉莉的。\n公主是如此相信的喔……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "258d37672ceb971f8aa60f4f0969b9a956f762e4b4e94562cf16e12781432c8d", "ja": "わかるわ～！　でも、私のところには来ないっていうか\n投票しないのよね。王子様だけにウブなのかしら……。", "zh": "我懂～！但别说王子不会来找我了，\n他连票都不会投给我啊～该说王子就是纯情吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "c9589981ca77778256366af59b2d2ebab37ff9359dd801bdcebb3cc3faad4fbb", "ja": "私は、えっと～……。よく分からないですけど、\n楽しい結婚式にしたいな～って思ってます♪", "zh": "我的话，嗯～虽然不是很清楚，\n但我想办一场有趣的婚礼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "d806108679f26a7e9b746f3921c0d10a95a0f58f73d8702cca9f562b3accff15", "ja": "お婿さんと一緒に、空にビューンって！\nダイブしながら誓いの言葉を、なんてなんて♪", "zh": "跟新郎一起「咻」地飞在空中！\n一边俯冲一边说结婚誓言……我随便讲讲的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1f241ad31018550bbedb815f94f4c3b26a098aea3385eef985a785c5f54d3c5d", "ja": "ダイブ……？", "zh": "俯冲……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1034_046rio", "source_sha256": "12456d840c8213a6ec681bc7ca88729487be2ccc38ec186e9e0fc4296586c422", "ja": "刺激的じゃない♪　あ、千鶴ちゃんはセレブだし、\nやっぱりセレブな式がいいの？", "zh": "听起来很刺激耶♪啊，千鹤毕竟是名流，\n你还是会比较想办名流式的婚礼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1035_038chz", "source_sha256": "aa7a37935906a558254069ea576cea0afb6e504e44ad7a46b178bf26874a5ea2", "ja": "ええと……そ、そうですわね！　セ、セレブたるもの、\n結婚式もゴージャスでなくてはいけませんもの。", "zh": "呃……是、是啊！身为名流，\n婚礼当然也要办得豪华一点才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1036_038chz", "source_sha256": "b134c3b3d175ea16eb6ee1e507e17dc1390c5ab16cc99f01cc81a91bbe324ce1", "ja": "海外の五つ星ホテルに、商店街の皆……ゲホ、ゴホッ。\nたくさんのVIPをお招きいたしますわ。", "zh": "办在国外的五星级饭店，邀请商店街的……\n咳咳！邀请很多VIP来参加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "c820cb7448f3215a9cc164bb889d8220048627bace217c10813b42d81dd69fdc", "ja": "ドレスはオートクチュールの、オーダーメイドで……。\nあの、あくまで、もし結婚するならのお話ですわよ？", "zh": "婚纱则是高级服装店的订制服……\n不过，这只是假设要结婚的情况喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1038_046rio", "source_sha256": "d74411bf0c64238f414f8b21730c5cdb82edba8a7e578fbf3dd4ac5b334f5f78", "ja": "わかってるってば♪　でも、オートクチュールかぁ。\nそうよね～。やっぱりいろいろ違うわよね～。", "zh": "我知道啦♪不过，高级订制服啊～\n也对啦～我和千鹤果然差很多呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1039_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e1dea43d075510214d8645d6a50fd8699b47e454eeca7394ba68c460d6b9a0bd", "ja": "きっとティアラもパニエも、素敵なんだろうなぁ……♪", "zh": "头冠和澎裙一定也会很漂亮吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "bc1c90073bebc870ae2c51713a9a5d866416588181fbc705ca42d17e6f134ec1", "ja": "（こんな調子で、理想の結婚式談義は、\n大学生組の撮影が始まるまで続いた……）", "zh": "（大家就这样持续聊着理想的婚礼\n直到大学生组开始拍摄为止……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1042_p", "source_sha256": "703e87e089d37625feb47e2e4f129f5bd0914cd058782450707794d0754b667a", "ja": "よし、写真の確認は終わった。\n次は楽曲発注のメールを……と。", "zh": "好，照片都检查完了。\n接着要传歌曲发包的mail……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1043_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1044_038chz", "source_sha256": "b1f5a096a66be89429c45c6dbe6633cbbb2b6b79a9e5783ba959aa9cfbfd5b1b", "ja": "遅くまでお疲れさまですわ、{$P$}。\n差し入れを持ってきましたの。", "zh": "忙到这么晚真是辛苦了，{$P$}。\n本小姐带了慰劳品过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "ea85362c0869ac7f8b03af7d00c6c322d4f181c523ae0f08f752675099c622ce", "ja": "あっ、千鶴さん。ありがとうございます！\n仕事を全部片付けて、あとでいただきますね。", "zh": "啊，千鹤。谢谢你！\n我把工作全部弄完之后再吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1046_038chz", "source_sha256": "3b5e504e8c5db491dc8e919ef849352e14b2130870c62309c9b554c38e0998e0", "ja": "あとで、なんて……。\nちゃんと休憩しないと、体によくありませんわよ。", "zh": "什么之后再吃……\n你要好好休息，不然对身体不好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1047_038chz", "source_sha256": "9bf135fb9471a2ad5839bcc83970c7c3db209e2cd4e12bc23dbf6b7d7332a6fd", "ja": "『ハピマリ』は765プロみんなが出演してますもの。\n{$P$}も大変なはず……。", "zh": "765艺能的所有人都要参与拍摄『幸福婚礼』，\n{$P$}应该也很辛苦才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1048_038chz", "source_sha256": "665b565f4109dd8ee0ea6dd36f7fc981b4a95a811b12dbc198c45333934c4f93", "ja": "お夜食くらい食べてもバチは当たらないと思いますわ。\n……それに、コロッケも冷めてしまいますし。", "zh": "休息吃个宵夜应该也不会遭天谴的。\n而且……再不吃，可乐饼会冷掉啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1049_p", "source_sha256": "6ce515593f0aa73fec7231262433f1c6d05bc812e1b2202ba6a935db0b2cee80", "ja": "わ、わかりました。\nそれじゃ、キリもいいし……今いただきますね。", "zh": "我、我知道了。\n既然也到一个段落……那我现在就来吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "fbeb56266d1f67f5305e71a21c016d4de226aa4856c65409d5d36b4541f7dddc", "ja": "あ、いつものコロッケだけじゃなくて、\nお惣菜も入っているんですね。", "zh": "啊，不只是常有的可乐饼，\n还有其他熟食在里面呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1051_038chz", "source_sha256": "1df8b3542992b59babfa30894636aa425961c04d3d7b80206f80a6276e9892e1", "ja": "ええ。そのきんぴらごぼうと卵焼きは、わたくしが\n作ったんですの。ちょうど劇場の冷蔵庫に余り物が……", "zh": "嗯，那个金平牛蒡跟玉子烧是本小姐做的。\n正好剧场的冰箱里有剩下的食材……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1052_p", "source_sha256": "a49b800429a5b8085411ef3a67cf1fe3488baa1018436528db46b0a74a9991d0", "ja": "えっ。これ、千鶴さんの手作りなんですか？", "zh": "咦？这是千鹤亲手做的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1053_038chz", "source_sha256": "774a246f3b2d1aa7d713a322d2b3c9a1d83ee0c69f434fa14d225e406e1ad6ac", "ja": "はっ。……そ、そうなんですの！　普段はお母……\nシェフに任せていますけれど、料理は得意ですのよ。", "zh": "啊……没、没错！虽然平常都交给妈……\n交给主厨料理，但本小姐是很会做菜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1054_038chz", "source_sha256": "e6c1e4226c87520788b523bb1bdef30d8f688dab893b1f6bae531373f7810481", "ja": "味付けはシェフ直伝ですので、ご安心くださいな。\nこれもセレブのたしなみですわ♪", "zh": "调味经过主厨的亲自传授，放心地吃吧。\n这也是名流应有的素养♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1055_p", "source_sha256": "6afd1eb1e0db7d9acf5b0730df2f01907c61cb889ca933aa1bf1d3bbbd733933", "ja": "そうでしたか……千鶴さんの手料理が食べられるなんて\n嬉しいです。それじゃ、いただきます！", "zh": "这样啊……居然能吃到千鹤做的菜，真高兴。\n那我开动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1056_038chz", "source_sha256": "22e004d5917daa93581c5d8c92105850b21259026c919381228d65684806ae38", "ja": "足りなかったら言ってくださいましね。\nキッチンに、まだまだたくさんありますから♪", "zh": "不够的话再跟本小姐说，\n厨房里还有很多♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1057_p", "source_sha256": "61056471ab4a2da889bf4ce5dcb6e81d4cb583a535005a148b519677f42c4c74", "ja": "えっ。余り物なのに、そんなにたくさん……？", "zh": "咦，明明是剩下的食材却能做这么多……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1058_038chz", "source_sha256": "af2c4f923eb05f4cdc087302f0c38acaa4a03eb3461b2a15c0a7caae3f09e6d7", "ja": "はっ。……そ、そうなんですの！　卵が特大の、\nえ、LLLサイズで！　ごぼうも1メートルほど！", "zh": "啊……没、没错！鸡蛋是特大号的、LLL尺寸！\n牛蒡也有1公尺那么长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_04_1059_p", "source_sha256": "cea903d588d2f23e7925c535edb4fd7017e82d285531d91366b6526e7d2ad623", "ja": "（千鶴さんの差し入れは身にしみた。……無理を\nしない程度に、残りの仕事も頑張るとしよう！）", "zh": "（千鹤的慰劳品真温暖人心……\n在不要太累的前提下，剩下的工作也努力完成吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
